  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "description": "Calendar leave-by, shared by Kotlin CalendarLeaveBy (core/common) and Swift CalendarLeaveBy. fold(text) = lowercase, then map Greek tonos/dialytika vowels to plain, final sigma to sigma, and Latin àáâèéêëìíîòóôùúûç to plain. classify(title, location): text = fold(title + ' ' + location), tokens = split on anything that is not [0-9a-zα-ω]; first class whose substring keyword is contained or token keyword is a whole token, in order flight, longDistance, venue, appointment, else default. Keyword lists are in 'keywords' below. buffer minutes: {\"flight\": 120, \"longDistance\": 25, \"venue\": 30, \"appointment\": 15, \"default\": 5}; flight uses flightBufferMinutes when it is one of 90/120/150. margin = min(20, transfers*2 + ceil(firstLegHeadway/2) + 5 if raining + 5 if alertOnRoute). arriveBy = start - buffer; leaveAt = arriveBy - (journeyMinutes + margin) minutes. state: now < leaveAt scheduled; < arriveBy leaveNow; < start late; else past. notifications (only those strictly after now, in this order): flightChecklist at leaveAt - 180 min (flight only), headsUp at leaveAt - 15 min, leaveNow at leaveAt. Eligibility in order: allDay, declined, past (start <= now), beyondHorizon (start > now + 48 h), unresolved destination, else eligible. Reschedule when |newLeaveAt - oldLeaveAt| >= 300 s.",
